        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="onegrid-reference-naming:inputs" value="&lt;b&gt;Example inputs used for the patterns&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;namePrefix = &amp;#x27;pcpro&amp;#x27; (variable in main.bicep); container and deployment names are fixed strings&lt;br&gt;&amp;lt;unique&amp;gt; = uniqueString(resourceGroup().id): 13 characters, stable per resource group (example a1b2c3d4e5f6g)&lt;br&gt;&amp;lt;suffix&amp;gt; = first 8 characters of &amp;lt;unique&amp;gt; (amlSuffix; example a1b2c3d4)&lt;br&gt;&amp;lt;unique12&amp;gt; = first 12 characters of &amp;lt;unique&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;lt;run&amp;gt; = 13 characters of uniqueString(resourceGroup().id, deploymentToken); new each deployment&lt;br&gt;Parsed 44 declarations; 16 skipped (role assignments, blob service, Microsoft Graph)&lt;br&gt;pi-events-stream (Eventstream) is published separately, not by the provisioner&lt;br&gt;Purposes ending in &amp;#x27;· if ...&amp;#x27; are off in the portal&amp;#x27;s default selection&lt;br&gt;Recommendation: &amp;lt;env&amp;gt; = dev, test or prod; &amp;lt;region&amp;gt; = short code such as weu" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D3DBE1;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="927" y="1444" width="833" height="212" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
